  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1307\">\n<p data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1307\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Confirms diagnosis of <strong data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1165\">Wilson Disease</strong>, an autosomal recessive disorder caused by mutations in the <strong data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1240\">ATP7B gene</strong>, leading to copper accumulation in liver, brain, and other tissues</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1487\">\n<p data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1319\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Helps in:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1487\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1358\">\n<p data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1358\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1343\">Early diagnosis</strong> and management</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1423\">\n<p data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1423\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1383\">Family screening</strong> (carrier testing or prenatal diagnosis)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1487\">\n<p data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1487\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1447\">Differentiating</strong> from other liver/neurological disorders</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1549\">\n<p data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1549\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1509\">Positive result</strong>: Mutation(s) detected in <strong data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1549\">ATP7B gene</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1677\">\n<p data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1677\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1571\">Negative result</strong>: No pathogenic mutation found, but doesn&rsquo;t completely rule out the disease due to limitations of the test</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
